{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>In all My house he is trusted.</b> It is known throughout the world that he saw of the glory of the Shechinah what no other prophets saw, for he was the father of prophets. And we do not find that he said 'such and such I saw,' as many prophets did. Concerning him Solomon said in his wisdom: נאמן רוח מכסה דבר. And in the Jerusalem Targum it is translated: <b>בכל ביתי</b> — 'among all My people he is trusted,' the language of 'the house of Jacob' and 'the house of Joseph.' Another interpretation: all the people of My house hold him to be trusted."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:17:37.425804843Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}